     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have a main table in my Shiny app which its cell will be highlighted when clicked. Currently, there is some issue with the highlighting event. When a user clicks randomly on table cells, all clicked cells remain highlighted. I want to achieve two things<div><br></div><div>1. Only highlight the latest cell being clicked</div><div>2. Programmatically highlight certain cells (I do refresh the table with updated data and the highlighted cell becomes non-highlighted but I do maintain the clicked cell index and I want to re-highlight it.)</div><div><br></div><div>What is the configuration needed toachieve #1? </div><div>Are there any function that allows me to #2?</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br><br>output$tbl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">summary </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sketch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> htmltools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">withTags</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;display&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        thead</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          tr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;SS&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;NOS&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;EQ&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;PR&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;OP&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          tr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;US&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;TNG&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;XC&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;SPCC&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;LT&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;CO&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;TC&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>      v$summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tbl </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> datatable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">options</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;t&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">searching</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">columnDefs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">className </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;dt-center&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> targets </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">visible</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">11</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            container </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sketch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> escape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">selection </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cell&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        formatStyle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<a href=\"http://EQ.US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://EQ.US&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389300170000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FDUe_nNicKrRraWpY0LXq\">EQ.US</a>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;color1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cell&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> backgroundColor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> styleEqual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;yellow&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>        formatStyle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;EQ.TNG&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;color2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cell&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">backgroundColor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> styleEqual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;yellow&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        formatStyle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;EQ.XC&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;color3&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cell&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">backgroundColor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> styleEqual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;yellow&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}