     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>with formatStyle() you could achieve highlighting certain cells (or rows/columns), see <a href=\"https://rstudio.github.io/DT/010-style.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudio.github.io/DT/010-style.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389300177000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UdcFJDwhmdMXdlvtjkkut\">https://rstudio.github.io/DT/010-style.html</a></div><div>Not sure about #1, maybe you can add an onlick event handler?</div><div><br></div><div>best,</div><div>Ger</div></div>"
