     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Monday, 24 July 2017 09:09:44 UTC+2, Kok Leong Fong  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I have a main table in my Shiny app which its cell will be highlighted when clicked. Currently, there is some issue with the highlighting event. When a user clicks randomly on table cells, all clicked cells remain highlighted. I want to achieve two things<div><br></div><div>1. Only highlight the latest cell being clicked</div><div>2. Programmatically highlight certain cells (I do refresh the table with updated data and the highlighted cell becomes non-highlighted but I do maintain the clicked cell index and I want to re-highlight it.)</div><div><br></div><div>What is the configuration needed toachieve #1? </div><div>Are there any function that allows me to #2?</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br><br>output$tbl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">summary </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sketch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> htmltools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">withTags</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;display&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        thead</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          tr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;SS&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;NOS&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;EQ&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;PR&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colspan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;OP&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</sp